{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2022-01-04 11:27:00', 'title': 'BALL TO DONATE $1 MILLION TO COLORADO WILDFIRE RECOVERY EFFORTS', 'text': 'WESTMINSTER, COLO., JAN. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BALL CORPORATION (NYSE: BLL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BALL FOUNDATION WILL DONATE $1 MILLION AND DEPLOY OTHER DISASTER RELIEF EFFORTS TO SUPPORT COMMUNITIES IN COLORADO DEVASTATED BY THE RECENT WILDFIRES.'}